  unitName: Dark Lantern Lumie
  unitId: 60565
  unitNumber: 998
  description: A magician from the Bariura Empire belonging to the special military
    force supervised directly by Shida. Though her personality was gentle, her beloved
    demonic lantern is said to have held a great amount of dark power. Due to her
    lantern's ability to absorb and materialize any surrounding chemical elements,
    Shida took a particular interest in Lumie and had her help him conduct confidential
    experiments in absolute secrecy. Their research progressed at a faster rate than
    they had initially expected, but Lumie distanced herself from it all shortly
    afterwards to conduct her own experiments.
  summonDesc: Are you keen on my lantern or me? I'll show you lots of spirits to
    celebrate our meeting.
  fusionDesc: I can feel my lantern's will... If it keeps absorbing dark power, I
    don't know what will happen.
